WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 25 - Heavenly Light

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.380
And we're rolling in five!

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:44.200
And five, four...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:46.440
Satoko's strong and proud.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.430
She's always self-confident.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.510
Oh, Miss Satoko! How nice to meet you!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.940
The pleasure is all mine!

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.560
All right, that's a wrap!

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:09.970
You're doing a great job, much better than in rehearsals!

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.560
Thank you very much!

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.700
What's strange about acting on TV is that they call cut...

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.230
just as you're getting into it.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.100
Wait!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:22.520
You're not allowed in there. It's a restricted area!

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.370
See you later.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.380
Good morning.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.210
My name's Satomi.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:24.360
Good morning.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.630
Satomi, I'll introduce you then.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:28.930
This is Maya Kitajima.

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.150
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.760
I'm Shigeru Satomi.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.600
You won the Academy's Best Supporting Actress Award, didn't you?

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:35.890
That's amazing.

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:37.780
Oh, is it?

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:42.190
I'm playing Takeshi, who shows up in the sixth episode.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:46.650
Takeshi knows your father's hiding the foreigner who killed his father,

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.120
so he breaks into your house.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.340
So, I guess that makes our characters enemies.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.670
Please don't hold it against me!

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.410
Likewise!

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.060
I'll introduce you to the others as well.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.610
That'd be great.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.360
Catch you later!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.540
Miss Mizuki, why do I have to keep my costume on to go...

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.370
to the office?

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.130
Is this a press conference?

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.660
Heavenly Light
Rainbow Memory

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.360
Ayumi!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.240
Haven't seen you in a while...

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.910
Can you tell us a little bit about your costume?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.300
I'm starring in a new thriller that's starting in spring.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.080
This is the costume I'll be wearing in the pilot for <i>Rainbow Memory</i>.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:49.470
<i>Heavenly Light</i> will air at eight o'clock on MBA,

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.640
and <i>Rainbow Memory</i> is airing at nine on local stations.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.040
We bring your attention to these two actresses who are vying...

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.600
for the starring role in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>, Miss Ayumi Himekawa and Miss Maya Kitajima.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.520
For the time being, both candidates for the role are under contract at Daito Entertainment.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:07.170
Daito Entertainment has put on an impressive ad campaign for both of these shows.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:10.030
This is looking good!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:15.430
I'm going to be compared to Ayumi.

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:22.110
I bet this is giving you pleasure, Masumi Hayami.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.810
I'm now a poster girl for Daito.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:35.530
Now please, move a little closer together and give us a smile!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.500
The Two Candidates
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.890
We bring your attention to these two actresses who are vying...

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.800
for the starring role in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>, Miss Ayumi Himekawa and Miss Maya Kitajima.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.730
I must succeed.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:49.240
I'm going to be compared to Ayumi.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.710
All of Japan will make comparisons between us!

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.280
Hey, your acting's wooden!

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.720
Sorry!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.660
Take fifteen, guys.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.670
Here you go.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.770
Thanks.

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:12.090
You know, before I got my first job, I performed <i>Hamlet</i> at a community theater,

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:14.060
but it was a complete flop.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:19.700
Just before I went on stage, they told me there was a producer in the audience...

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.090
scouting me for a possible television role.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.740
I tried too hard to impress and I ended up going overboard.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:32.530
You'll do fine if you just play Satoko without worrying what other people around you are thinking.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:34.790
He knows.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:37.460
He somehow knows how self-conscious I'm feeling.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.980
Hey, Shigeru!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.990
When will you be done?

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.720
I'm running late today.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.360
Oh!

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:52.060
What about tomorrow? Will you be finishing any earlier?

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:52.950
I'm not sure yet.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.220
You know, I've been coming by every day!

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.450
Crap, I'd better go!

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.260
See you later!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.260
See you later!

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:00.160
Shall we call it there?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:00.940
Sure.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:08.750
Satomi... thanks for cheering me up.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.540
I'm beat.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.800
I wonder what everyone else is up to.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.490
I'm sure Ms. Tsukikage hasn't abandoned you.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:23.640
Hang in there!

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.010
We're watching you on TV!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.650
Write to us when you get the chance!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.290
Take care of yourself.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.620
Thanks, you guys.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.260
Break a leg!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.680
Ms. Tsukikage.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.640
Mother.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:55.510
My father's innocent, so why must he be treated this way?!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.720
I won't forget this. I <i>will</i> have my revenge!

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:02.010
Is it true that the family of Lord Tanuma has kidnapped him?!

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:04.000
Y-Yes.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.420
Then, take me to them!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:09.040
Good job, everyone!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.630
I'm off for the day.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.440
That was quick.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.580
Let's go, Maya!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.930
Yes, sir!

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.500
Take this, you ruffian!

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.020
And cut!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.730
That was a wonderful expression you had there, Maya.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.160
Really?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.490
Is it all gone?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.720
Thank you very much!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.060
Oh, there's a piece left!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.120
Actually, that's Maya's.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.040
Well, I'm taking it now.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.160
It's good. Kind of like an indirect kiss.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.050
You're such a dirty old man!

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.750
What gave it away?

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.660
We have no foreigners living here!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:52.170
You can't just barge into someone's home like this. It's barbaric!

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:56.150
I know you're hiding him here!

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:59.710
When Tanuma gets back, tell him I've taken his daughter with me!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.400
I'll trade her for the foreigner!

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.890
Miss!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:16.460
What happened to her all of a sudden?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:23.690
Hey...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.060
I-I...

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.120
Hey, you!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.150
Where are you going?! Come back!

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.270
I know you're in here.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:50.750
If you don't come out, I'm coming in.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.790
I can't go back there; I'm too embarrassed.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:58.030
You ran away from a stage!

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.240
Because this is for television, we can still make something of the scene,

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.010
but this would have been disastrous on a real stage!

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:06.740
Do you have any idea what you've just done?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.220
I'm sorry.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:13.730
Well, it happens. Let's go again from the top.

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.420
Welcome back!

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:28.760
So, even though you're all adults, you're afraid of me?

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.050
Takeshi...

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.520
Satomi...

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.130
I can't stop thinking about him.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.700
I can't even read my script properly; all I see is letters...

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.830
and I can't get into Satoko's head.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.580
What's wrong with me?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.850
Who do you think you are, anyway?

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.060
You're from that group...

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.180
Shigeru belongs to us.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.850
You think we're just going to let you act the way you do around him?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.210
What way?

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.520
Don't play dumb.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.860
You're trying to put him on a leash! Admit it.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.820
If you try anything else, I'm going to...

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:04.670
Hey there!

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.260
What are you doing in here?

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.700
Oops! Security have found me!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.180
You need to leave!

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:11.400
We were just leaving anyway.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.920
They think I'm trying to...

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.340
Give me back my memory!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.760
I will, even if it's the last thing I do!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:25.910
Oh, Youji.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.270
And that's a wrap!

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:30.690
So, what's it like? Acting with a prodigy?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.230
Hey, I'm also a star, you know.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:37.250
It starts getting boring when that's the only question I get asked.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:42.260
Her acting's good, no doubt about it, but I've found a weakness in it.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:45.400
A weakness? You can't be serious! Tell me!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.320
The next chance you get, take a closer look at the monitor...

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.630
when she looks at me.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.360
There's no love in her eyes.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.350
They're the eyes of someone who has never experienced love.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:05.630
There's no desire in her eyes and the viewers watching the show will catch on to that fast.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:09.420
They'll realize that the main character is just pretending to be in love.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:13.050
Eyes that have never loved...

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:27.970
I thought there wasn't a role I couldn't play.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:32.550
And yet, he says that there's no love in my eyes.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.490
What should I do?

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:41.020
Hey, don't stand in front of the monitor!

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:42.640
I'm sorry.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.360
Who are you anyway?

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.950
My name is Hazama. Susumu Hazama.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.930
Don't you only have one line? How long are you going to stare at the script?

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.660
Well, you see...

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:55.380
I'm not saying enthusiasm is a bad thing, but try not to get in the way.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.130
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.110
Miss Ayumi Himekawa!

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.010
You're trying really hard, aren't you?!

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:12.070
Good job, everyone!

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:13.010
Yes, good job.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.370
See you tomorrow!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.000
Oh...

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:20.190
Would you like some juice?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.340
Yes, I would.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.490
Here you go.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.060
Thank you.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:37.790
So, this is what they were talking about. Those eyes!

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:40.210
Those furtive glances...

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:41.810
No, no!

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.480
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:46.590
Satoko's expression is all wrong!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.360
I'm sorry. I'm overdoing it.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.590
No, it's not you.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.930
I want you to practice this scene by yourself until you get it right!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.950
Go on! What are you waiting for?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:01.220
It was around this time that Daito Entertainment launched their advertising campaign...

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:05.040
to get Maya's name out into the public eye.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:09.420
They organized several events to run alongside the show's broadcasting schedule.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:13.010
She has a starring role in a summer movie and they have already decided her next...

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:16.180
big theatrical role as well.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:20.190
After investigating her personal history,

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.510
it appears that her mother, Haru Kitajima, is considered missing.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:27.380
Keep that out of the papers for now.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.020
I have an idea.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:32.000
You're saying she went blind naturally?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.080
Yes. She was found collapsed one day and now...

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.850
she's been admitted to a small hospital in the Nagano mountains.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:43.370
Then, I want you to give the hospital director plenty of money...

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:46.730
to keep Maya's mother out of the papers for now.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:49.760
I also want you to make sure she receives no information on her daughter.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:53.810
It'll be good publicity if the media gets riled up...

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.710
before her mother is finally found.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:58.650
Until I say otherwise, this is to remain top secret.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.760
Do I make myself clear?

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:00.810
Yes, sir.

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:09.310
If she knew about this, she'd probably hate me enough to kill me.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:14.290
Why does my chest hurt?

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.160
Mr. Masumi.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:21.460
I'd like you to officially put me in charge of Maya Kitajima as her manager.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.060
What are you talking about?

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:28.350
You can't just leave her in the hands of anyone else at a time like this.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:32.830
She... She's in love...

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:38.620
with Shigeru Satomi.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.610
In love?

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:51.590
Whenever I'm around Satomi, Satoko just disappears and I don't know why.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:56.100
I just can't get Satoko's feelings down.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.130
I can't believe this is the girl...

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:03.630
who went out on stage by herself in the Japanese National Acting Competition.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:07.480
I had no idea she was hiding a fragile inner-self.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:16.230
I-I...

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.690
Shigeru!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.730
How late are you gonna be today? Very late?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.670
I have a lot of work to do today.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:29.280
We don't care if you're running late, so can we wait for you?

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.700
Do me a favor and just go home, all right?

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.250
I still haven't got my lines down, so please...

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:43.650
He's acting strangely. He was never like this before.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.150
He's really avoiding us.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:56.590
Some provisions for my hostage, Satoko - Takeshi

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:58.170
Satomi!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.410
He's worried about me!

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.230
I have to do this.

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.300
I don't want to make him dislike me.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.910
How dare you?!

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:18.630
If my father has abandoned me for a foreigner, it means that foreigner is worth...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:21.090
much more than I am!

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:25.060
Which means I definitely won't tell you anything.

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:28.050
Great! She's completely turned it around!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.230
That Satoko you just showed us was fantastic!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:35.640
He praised me! Satomi complimented me!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.500
Rumor has it that they're seeing each other.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.250
What?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.540
Yeah, they meet up when they're not even scheduled for filming and...

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.540
Good morning!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:45.230
Why would a prodigy like her go out with a guy like him?

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.680
Shush! She'll hear you!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.680
OK, let's test the equipment out.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.970
Her acting style has changed, wouldn't you agree?

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:58.570
Now she's going to tell Youji about her wistful memories...

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:07.310
It really is different. There's love in her eyes now.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:10.300
I've got a schedule for next year already?

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.550
You won't have a lot of time to attend school.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.600
Get ready.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.500
But...

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:17.060
Maya, you have to watch what you do more carefully.

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:17.570
What do you mean?

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:24.760
Shigeru Satomi may be a nice young man, but he's a teen idol.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.890
You must never forget that.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:32.990
In this world, Maya, there's always someone trying to trip you up.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.880
Your enemies are all around you.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.920
You're not allowed to fall in love.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:40.870
Once this show is on the air, you will no longer be a regular member of the public.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.920
You're going to be a star!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.010
We would like to thank you all for coming here today.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.650
We have one final request before we leave:

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.610
we would like everyone to help us look for Maya Kitajima's mother.

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.100
She is missing.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.480
You have to give us more information than that!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.760
Why are you bringing up my mom, Miss Mizuki?!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:24.180
Isn't that the girl whose mother they're looking for?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:26.120
Oh yeah, it's Maya Kitajima!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.190
What a pretty girl!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.680
They say she's going to be in a period drama. It sounds good!

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.200
Where are you, Mom?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.660
Heavenly Light

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:38.290
Good morning!

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.840
What's going on?

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:50.550
She worked so hard to make it onto this show,

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.400
and now, just so you can get even more publicity,

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.070
they've increased your screen time by cutting almost all of hers!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:19:00.040
I had a scene with her and it's all on the cutting room floor!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.300
This is all your fault!

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.150
Come now, she's not the one who cut the scene.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.810
But if it wasn't for her, this wouldn't have happened!

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:12.980
I just wanted to say I'm sorry.

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.380
Go away!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.010
I don't even want to look at you!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.810
Oh, hello! You're Miss Mizuki from Daito Entertainment, aren't you?

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:29.200
Hello, Miss Yamazaki. It's been a while.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.110
So, that's the new girl?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:37.840
Well, you always had a knack for selling junk.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.220
That's the famous actress, Ryoko Yamazaki.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:46.070
She's been the poster girl for Matsugami Electronics for the last eight years.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.250
Oh, I've seen those posters.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:51.450
She's made an image for herself as a good-natured homemaker, but...

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.770
in reality, the woman's a self-centered diva.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:58.760
She must be pretty angry that a newcomer is hogging the spotlight.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.370
You'd best stay out of her way.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:10.140
"This is a protest against Daito Entertainment and Maya Kitajima."

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:13.630
"For the movie, <i>White Jungle</i>, you forcibly took the main role...

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:16.690
away from the singer, Mari Tomoe, and gave it to Maya Kitajima."

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:20.900
"She must be removed from this role immediately, or else..."

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.920
Miss Mizuki, is this for real?

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:23.960
It is.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.020
Why didn't you tell me about this?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.260
And what would you have done if I'd told you?

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.460
Would you have forfeited your role in the movie?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.900
I'm scared. Why am I afraid?

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:37.490
I wasn't paying attention to where I was standing.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:42.640
I didn't realize that, when you're bathed in light, it casts a shadow behind you.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:45.720
That shadow scares me.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:48.860
And now, Scene 27!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.060
Places!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.380
They're all looking at me.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.260
Everyone's staring at me.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.780
It looks like we have a situation.

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.260
There's someone out there trying to get to Maya.

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.700
I want you to keep an eye on her.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:18.920
Sure.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:22.940
Satoko, these are sweets from my country.

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.320
They look delicious!

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.990
I'm going to try some.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.610
What's she doing?

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:37.110
She's acting strangely!

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.520
Get a doctor!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:40.310
Someone, call for a doctor!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:45.300
There are several people wanting to push Maya off the stairs to stardom.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:49.590
And yet, this is a mere prelude to the hatred Maya will face.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
Asa kara yoru made yoru kara asa made

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
From morning until night, from dusk till dawn,

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
Futari ai no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
you can feel the warmth of our love.

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
Shunkashuutou mo ippun ichibyou mo

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
All year round, every minute and every second,

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
Futari hada no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
you can feel the warmth of our skin.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
Kono dokidoki wa makka ni moeru taiyou

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
This excitement is burning brightly like the sun,

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
Atsuku moete atsuku togashite

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
let us burn brightly, let us burn until we're hot

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
Koi wo shimashou!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
and make love!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Sunao na mama dakiaou!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Let's hold and be true to each other!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
Isso mekimeki nekki! mekimeki daisuki!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
And let's add more heat! I love the heat!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Aishiae!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Feel the love!

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:25.400
Why?

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.890
Who would do something like that?

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:32.010
Please don't get in my way! Just let me act!

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:38.220
The only people encouraging me now are Satomi and the new girl, Norie Otobe.

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:43.260
Thank you! That's right! I won't let this keep me down!

00:23:44.380 --> 00:23:48.070
I'm doing this for my mother as well, because she might be out there somewhere...

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 26 - The Shadows Behind Maya

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:51.510
watching my Satoko.
